{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002340/extras/2ff1de62121a7892e472bacedf105482.avif?t=1759488977\" data-has-big width=1560 height=643 /></span>The <strong>DEMO</strong>\u00a0experience is limited the first level and introductory chapter of <strong>Hell Maiden</strong> \u2014 <u>any progress will not be saved or transferable to the full game client.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002340/extras/85894d577df6d5d3367207a2dca9f0ac.avif?t=1759488977\" data-has-big width=1560 height=341 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 The complete\u00a0<strong>first level of Hell</strong> Maiden,\u00a0<strong>Limbo</strong>\u00a0\u2014 with <strong>enemies to beat</strong>, <strong>quests</strong> and <strong>challenges</strong> to overcome, and a\u00a0<strong>tough Boss Battle</strong> to beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>25+ abilities</strong> to mix, match and experiment with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>1 Poet of Limbo</strong> to rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>6</strong>\u00a0<strong>Weapon Cards</strong> and<strong>\u00a010 Mod Cards </strong>to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 The compelling <strong>introduction to the</strong>\u00a0<strong>narrative</strong> and new character dialogues unlocked with each individual run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002340/extras/288509a6aa052b01b1501b1013009042.poster.avif?t=1759488977\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002340/extras/288509a6aa052b01b1501b1